{"user": "how to decide who plays first?", "user_ts": "2026-08-19T11:12:24.710292+00:00", "assistant": "In standard Othello/Reversi, **Black always plays first**.\n\nUsually the game starts with 4 center discs:\n- White: **d4, e5**\n- Black: **e4, d5**\nThen **Black makes the first move**.\n\nIf you\u2019re choosing colors in a casual game, decide randomly or alternate each game.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-19T11:12:27.335716+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-19T11:12:28.435132+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 2, "General Principle": 3}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 0.6666666666666666, "General Principle": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["General Principle"], "llama": ["Board Report", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction"]}}
